 PCIe Gen 3</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Extras</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">Eightwood low-profile Antenna, 2x NF-A4x10 FLX 3-pin, 1x NF-A4x20 12v PWM</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">Thermals</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted mb-4\">Ambient: <!-- -->23<!-- -->°C</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Part</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Idle</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Gaming</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Stress</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">apu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>34<!-- -->–<!-- -->40<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>55<!-- -->–<!-- -->65<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>88<!-- -->–<!-- -->94<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">62w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">cpu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>34<!-- -->–<!-- -->40<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>55<!-- -->–<!-- -->65<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>88<!-- -->–<!-- -->94<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">62w</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Benchmarks</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">10,645</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">62<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">649</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,639</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">62<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">588</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">62<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">605</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">97</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">62<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,343</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">53.3</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">50w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">642</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">25.5</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">50w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,134</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">18.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">30w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">663</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">11.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">30w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">The M350 is a compact case suitable for APU/iGPU builds for HTPC, NAS, or basic server use. The case design is simple with removable top and partial side panels. It has tight tolerances and can only accommodate motherboards with PICO or DC-DC power supplies and small case fans. Supports dual 40mm x 20mm fans for intake/exhaust and optional top bracket for 2.5&quot; SATA/HDD or dual 40mm x 10mm fans. Front IO includes two hidden USB 2.0 Type A ports with no external extension holes. The ASUS Prime H610I-Plus D4 motherboard pairs well with the i5-12500TE, offering decent VRMs and NVMe heatsink, though it may not be suitable for CPUs exceeding 105W TDP. The 250W PICO PSU with 240W power brick handles the entire build drawing under 125W. Temperatures during normal use and light stress are appropriate for the case size, with stress testing showing CPU can throttle slightly but stays below Tj max limit. The case is straightforward to build in and the overall performance is adequate for basic workstation and HTPC applications.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">10,645</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:19%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->81<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">171.7</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">1<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">25.5<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:5%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->95<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">0.51</span> fps/w</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Explore</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\">r/sffpc</a></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> ComponentWatch. Prices updated every 30 minutes via affiliate links.</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static