ildren\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\",\"children\":\"Unigine Heaven\"}],[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\",\"children\":\"Res\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Score\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"FPS\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\",\"children\":\"Power\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"720p\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\",\"children\":\"720p\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"1,343\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\",\"children\":\"53.3\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\",\"children\":\"50w\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1080p\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\",\"children\":\"1080p\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"642\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\",\"children\":\"25.5\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\",\"children\":\"50w\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}],\"$L1c\"]}]]}]\n1d:T406,The M350 is a compact case suitable for APU/iGPU builds for HTPC, NAS, or basic server use. The case design is simple with removable top and partial side panels. It has tight tolerances and can only accommodate motherboards with PICO or DC-DC power supplies and small case fans. Supports dual 40mm x 20mm fans for intake/exhaust and optional top bracket for 2.5\" SATA/HDD or dual 40mm x 10mm fans. Front IO includes two hidden USB 2.0 Type A ports with no external extension holes. The ASUS Prime H610I-Plus D4 motherboard pairs well with the i5-12500TE, offering decent VRMs and NVMe heatsink, though it may not be suitable for CPUs exceeding 105W TDP. The 250W PICO PSU with 240W power brick handles the entire build drawing under 125W. Temperatures during normal use and light stress are appropriate for the case size, with stress testing showing CPU can throttle slightly but stays below Tj max limit. The case is straightforward to build in and the overall performance is adequate for basic workstation and HTPC applications.19:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\",\"children\":\"Builder notes\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\",\"children\":\"$1d\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Performance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\",\"children\":\"CPU — CB23 Multi\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"10,645\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"19%\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-1